{"4979760": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Super Beat 'Em Up World", "steam_appid": 4979760, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4979760/extras/f0fe5921bc351ac7d0cbca7c3c64f95f.avif?t=1787361238\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4979760/extras_big/f0fe5921bc351ac7d0cbca7c3c64f95f.avif?t=1787361238 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WELCOME TO THE ULTIMATE CO-OP ADVENTURE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab a friend and punch your way through a colorful adventure where every level is a giant theme park packed with outrageous attractions, hidden secrets, and over-the-top boss battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your prehistoric best friend <strong><i>TUU</i></strong> has vanished after a trip to the world's most spectacular theme parks. What begins as a rescue mission quickly spirals into something much bigger. Behind the roller coasters, water slides, ancient temples, and prehistoric attractions lies a sinister conspiracy orchestrated by the powerful <strong><i>DUX Corporation</i></strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight through unforgettable worlds, rescue your friends, uncover the truth, and stop <strong><i>DUX</i></strong> before its experiments reshape the future forever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4979760/extras/cb29f0557ab4edb30c4bce70aa28c374.poster.avif?t=1787361238\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4979760/extras/cb29f0557ab4edb30c4bce70aa28c374.webm?t=1787361238\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4979760/extras/cb29f0557ab4edb30c4bce70aa28c374.mp4?t=1787361238\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPLORE INCREDIBLE THEME PARKS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forget dark streets and abandoned warehouses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle your way through vibrant, handcrafted theme parks inspired by giant Mayan temples, tropical waterparks, futuristic laboratories, ancient megafauna, and more. Every world is filled with interactive attractions, environmental hazards, hidden collectibles, and spectacular boss encounters that constantly surprise you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FAST, SATISFYING BEAT 'EM UP COMBAT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy to pick up. Deep to master.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chain together flashy combos, devastating grabs, launch attacks, aerial juggles, and powerful Special Moves as you send enemies flying across the screen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Smash them into scenery, trigger environmental traps, discover combat puzzles, and use each arena to your advantage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4979760/extras/1857971e8a380ef675ac9f85a03f9d34.poster.avif?t=1787361238\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4979760/extras/1857971e8a380ef675ac9f85a03f9d34.webm?t=1787361238\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4979760/extras/1857971e8a380ef675ac9f85a03f9d34.mp4?t=1787361238\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EIGHT HEROES. EIGHT PLAYSTYLES.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from a cast of unforgettable fighters, each with their own personality, abilities, and fighting style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're crushing enemies with Nikki's overwhelming strength, unleashing Ivy's unpredictable inventions, singing opponents into submission with Angelo's operatic attacks, or discovering the rest of the crew, every character offers a fresh way to play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4979760/extras/d967dbc6ef437cfb16b620d939ef8e69.poster.avif?t=1787361238\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4979760/extras/d967dbc6ef437cfb16b620d939ef8e69.webm?t=1787361238\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4979760/extras/d967dbc6ef437cfb16b620d939ef8e69.mp4?t=1787361238\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >POWER UPS CHANGE EVERYTHING</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect ridiculous power-ups throughout your adventure that completely transform how you fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experiment with new abilities, discover powerful combinations, and adapt your strategy as every level throws new surprises your way.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BUILT FOR CO-OP</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything is better with friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo or team up locally with up to four players to battle through the entire campaign together. Revive teammates, combine attacks, discover secrets, and create the kind of chaotic moments only great couch co-op can deliver.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4979760/extras/9e561f497048fa155d20b7b6dacc0e66.poster.avif?t=1787361238\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4979760/extras/9e561f497048fa155d20b7b6dacc0e66.webm?t=1787361238\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4979760/extras/9e561f497048fa155d20b7b6dacc0e66.mp4?t=1787361238\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BIG BOSSES. BIGGER PERSONALITIES.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every world ends with an unforgettable showdown against larger-than-life villains from the <strong><i>DUX Corporation</i></strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each boss introduces unique mechanics, attack patterns, and cinematic moments that keep every encounter fresh and memorable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4979760/extras/d7ef919dd94fdcffae58f8da1f715483.poster.avif?t=1787361238\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4979760/extras/d7ef919dd94fdcffae58f8da1f715483.webm?t=1787361238\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4979760/extras/d7ef919dd94fdcffae58f8da1f715483.mp4?t=1787361238\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A WORLD WORTH SAVING</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beneath the bright attractions and playful charm hides a mystery waiting to be uncovered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As your search for <strong><i>TUU</i></strong> unfolds, you'll discover that the parks are only the surface of an operation far more dangerous than anyone imagined. Piece together the truth behind <strong><i>DUX Corporation</i></strong>, confront its eccentric villains, and fight to save your friend before it's too late.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1–4 Player Local Co-Op Story Mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1–4 Player Local Co-Op Arena Mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8 Unique Playable Heroes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Four Massive Theme Park Worlds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Action-Packed Beat 'Em Up Combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Platforming and Exploration</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Environmental Combat Puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlockable Costumes and Collectibles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Epic Boss Battles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hidden Secrets Throughout Every Level</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4979760/extras/f0fe5921bc351ac7d0cbca7c3c64f95f.avif?t=1787361238\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4979760/extras_big/f0fe5921bc351ac7d0cbca7c3c64f95f.avif?t=1787361238 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WELCOME TO THE ULTIMATE CO-OP ADVENTURE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab a friend and punch your way through a colorful adventure where every level is a giant theme park packed with outrageous attractions, hidden secrets, and over-the-top boss battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your prehistoric best friend <strong><i>TUU</i></strong> has vanished after a trip to the world's most spectacular theme parks. What begins as a rescue mission quickly spirals into something much bigger. Behind the roller coasters, water slides, ancient temples, and prehistoric attractions lies a sinister conspiracy orchestrated by the powerful <strong><i>DUX Corporation</i></strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight through unforgettable worlds, rescue your friends, uncover the truth, and stop <strong><i>DUX</i></strong> before its experiments reshape the future forever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4979760/extras/cb29f0557ab4edb30c4bce70aa28c374.poster.avif?t=1787361238\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4979760/extras/cb29f0557ab4edb30c4bce70aa28c374.webm?t=1787361238\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4979760/extras/cb29f0557ab4edb30c4bce70aa28c374.mp4?t=1787361238\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPLORE INCREDIBLE THEME PARKS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forget dark streets and abandoned warehouses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle your way through vibrant, handcrafted theme parks inspired by giant Mayan temples, tropical waterparks, futuristic laboratories, ancient megafauna, and more. Every world is filled with interactive attractions, environmental hazards, hidden collectibles, and spectacular boss encounters that constantly surprise you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FAST, SATISFYING BEAT 'EM UP COMBAT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy to pick up. Deep to master.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chain together flashy combos, devastating grabs, launch attacks, aerial juggles, and powerful Special Moves as you send enemies flying across the screen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Smash them into scenery, trigger environmental traps, discover combat puzzles, and use each arena to your advantage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4979760/extras/1857971e8a380ef675ac9f85a03f9d34.poster.avif?t=1787361238\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4979760/extras/1857971e8a380ef675ac9f85a03f9d34.webm?t=1787361238\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4979760/extras/1857971e8a380ef675ac9f85a03f9d34.mp4?t=1787361238\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EIGHT HEROES. EIGHT PLAYSTYLES.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from a cast of unforgettable fighters, each with their own personality, abilities, and fighting style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're crushing enemies with Nikki's overwhelming strength, unleashing Ivy's unpredictable inventions, singing opponents into submission with Angelo's operatic attacks, or discovering the rest of the crew, every character offers a fresh way to play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4979760/extras/d967dbc6ef437cfb16b620d939ef8e69.poster.avif?t=1787361238\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4979760/extras/d967dbc6ef437cfb16b620d939ef8e69.webm?t=1787361238\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4979760/extras/d967dbc6ef437cfb16b620d939ef8e69.mp4?t=1787361238\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >POWER UPS CHANGE EVERYTHING</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect ridiculous power-ups throughout your adventure that completely transform how you fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experiment with new abilities, discover powerful combinations, and adapt your strategy as every level throws new surprises your way.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BUILT FOR CO-OP</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything is better with friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo or team up locally with up to four players to battle through the entire campaign together. Revive teammates, combine attacks, discover secrets, and create the kind of chaotic moments only great couch co-op can deliver.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\">