 truth behind <strong><i>DUX Corporation</i></strong>, confront its eccentric villains, and fight to save your friend before it's too late.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1–4 Player Local Co-Op Story Mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1–4 Player Local Co-Op Arena Mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8 Unique Playable Heroes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Four Massive Theme Park Worlds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Action-Packed Beat 'Em Up Combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Platforming and Exploration</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Environmental Combat Puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlockable Costumes and Collectibles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Epic Boss Battles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hidden Secrets Throughout Every Level</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Embark on an action-packed co-op adventure through spectacular theme parks, master unique heroes and outrageous power-ups, battle unforgettable bosses, and uncover the sinister conspiracy behind the DUX Corporation while searching for your missing friend, TUU.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4979760/21e675861c8af224bbf332f69a1402d40c4fd035/header.jpg?t=1787361238", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4979760/bf13c669f80ab2558bdb644c88a7861c3ddf569c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787361238", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4979760/bf13c669f80ab2558bdb644c88a7861c3ddf569c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787361238", "website": "https://superbeatemupworld.com", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong>